OL,3,GNEWSASix things to see and do in 'one
OL,4,Aof the most breathtaking places on
OL,5,AEarth'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt might have raised a few eyebrows
OL,8,Famong the residents of Dumfries and
OL,9,FGalloway to see the area recognised as
OL,10,Fone of the top travel destinations on
OL,11,Fthe planet.
OL,13,FAlongside Melbourne in Australia,
OL,14,FJaipur in India and the island of
OL,15,FPuerto Rico, this corner of south-west
OL,16,FScotland was named on the National
OL,17,FGeographic Best in the World list for
OL,18,F2027.
OL,20,FIt picked out 25 must-visit locations
OL,21,Facross the globe for people planning
OL,22,Ftheir "next unforgettable trip".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
